+ 1&\t\t\n\t}\n$$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186054791 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-59eaa740-2224-50f3-a29a-b209a5484302" "question-7905141b-131b-5e75-9f8a-02832316e158"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186054377 :question/problem "Simplify the expression $2.5x+2y-x+1.5y.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we group the like terms.\n\n$$\n\\eqalign{\n\t\t2.5x+2y-x+1.5y &= \\[5pt]\n\t\t\\underbrace{2.5x-x}_{x \\textrm{ terms}}+\\underbrace{2y+1.5y}_{y \\textrm{ terms}} &\n\t}\n$$\n\nThen, we combine the like terms:\n\n$$\n\\eqalign{\n\t\t\\underbrace{2.5x-x}+\\underbrace{2y+1.5y} &= \\[5pt]\n\t\t(2.5-1)x + (2+1.5)y &=\\[5pt]\n\t\t1.5x + 3.5y\n\t}\n$$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "question-99943b2d-800d-508e-b6fa-b967f1e637ef" :question/id #uuid "99943b2d-800d-508e-b6fa-b967f1e637ef" :question/math-academy-id "q-178228" :question/problem "$2x+7x+2z=${{field-1}}\n$x\\,+$\n{{field-2}}$z$" :question/worked-solution "We have two like terms, $2x$ and $7x.$ \n\nTo collect these like terms, we combine them into a single term, adding their coefficients:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2x+7x+2z & = \\\\ (2x+7x)+2z & = \\\\ (2+7)x+2z & = \\\\ 9\\,x+2\\,z\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-4b0ee871-33d8-52d3-b926-0805e9aec8f4" "answer-field-8d93596e-85d1-5232-a7ce-d3bb08003b35"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-4b0ee871-33d8-52d3-b926-0805e9aec8f4" :answer-field/id #uuid "4b0ee871-33d8-52d3-b926-0805e9aec8f4" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-92345622-6263-5748-af9a-6054ca162c61" :answer-field/choices ["answer-92345622-6263-5748-af9a-6054ca162c61"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-92345622-6263-5748-af9a-6054ca162c61" :answer/id #uuid "92345622-6263-5748-af9a-6054ca162c61" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "9" :db/ensure [:answer/validate